        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Batty Zabella is a point-and-click horror comedy built using the limitations of real retro hardware. It also marks the debut of a new horror icon; Batty Zabella! Oh, and she's got a big problem - her house is haunted, and her family's missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will navigate the home via an onscreen cursor. Both mouse and keyboard are supported, with mouse support being toggled by clicking the right mouse button. Search the game's many backgrounds for items and clues to solve puzzles. Nearly all actions will be met with commentary from Batty herself, who faces the player on every screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory space is limited, and Batty also has a magical hairpin equipped at all times. This protects her from phantoms that will be encountered throughout the game, but it must be charged at a special location. If Batty takes too much damage, it's game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click:</strong> Toggle Mouse Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Z/Left Click:</strong> Accept</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X:</strong> Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>START:</strong> Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SELECT:</strong> Map</p>",
